      "message": "fix(motion): judge every piece of a grazing chord, not its midpoint\n\nWIP from the held worktree: chord_clears splits the chord at every\nboundary touch (collinear edge ends, tangent vertices) and checks the\nmidpoint of each piece.\n\nRefs #1620\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
